{"ID":"20240118151300-jo3nz93","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151300-jo3nz93","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151300-jo3nz93\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151300-4l9xtdu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240129170640-ay6dcf7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240129170640-ay6dcf7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:305,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:305\u0026#125;","title":"089别羁90屈草91淮木","type":"doc","updated":"20240129170731"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151300-4l9xtdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151300-4l9xtdu","updated":"20240122102621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"别羁"}]},{"ID":"20240122102621-ro97erd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102621-ro97erd","updated":"20240122102629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦微温，主风寒湿痹，身重四肢疼酸。寒邪历节痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102629-2cw24g5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102629-2cw24g5","updated":"20240122102633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"屈草"}]},{"ID":"20240122102637-z4sgljt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102637-z4sgljt","updated":"20240122102641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，主胸胁下痛邪气腹间寒热，阴痹，久服轻身益气耐老。因方药无人用，今无人识者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102641-p1jy4wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102641-p1jy4wt","updated":"20240122102645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"淮木"}]},{"ID":"20240122102645-izvqmnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102645-izvqmnt","updated":"20240122102653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦平，主久咳上气，伤中虚羸，女子阴蚀漏下，赤白沃。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102652-cbwsn8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102652-cbwsn8m"}},{"ID":"20240122102654-utpeteg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102654-utpeteg"}},{"ID":"20240122102654-2uybp5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102654-2uybp5e","updated":"20240122102703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第89呢，别羁，现在已经没有人用了，已经无人使用了，对哦没有人用了，哦诸位看一下就好了；"}]},{"ID":"20240129170632-i59y59i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129170632-i59y59i","updated":"20240129170638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有90味药，那个屈草；"}]},{"ID":"20240129170640-ay6dcf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129170640-ay6dcf7","updated":"20240129170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有呢91淮木，这三味药到现在也是无人能识了，这是很可惜的，当然了以后我们有机会，我们去旅游或怎么样，我们去找哦找出来哦，有的药反应要快，因为有的跟当地的方言有关系，就好像那个经方里面我们叫抵挡汤，抵挡，大家他们、他们就那样，大家就抵挡汤抵挡汤就结束了，其实你仔细想想看这个为什么叫抵挡，因为山东话抵挡抵挡就是“唯一、独一无二”，没有其他的方子可以这样，抵挡，直当这个，结果把他看成抵挡，就实际上有语言的关系嘛，所以读中医还要有点语言的天分，你要语言的天分很简单，多看看相声，相声常常讲那个语言哪，山西人怎么讲话，山东人怎么讲话，所以我们记得，但是我们会去看的时候，听，听到人家发音，发那个音，我们会想到这个药，那现在是失散了。"}]}]}